# The order the docs' HTTP Client screenshot asks for. The runner serves it on 127.0.0.1:8765 (#@ http 8765).

### Fetch an order
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/orders/42
Accept: application/json

### Create an order
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"sku": "A-1", "qty": 12}]}
